{"id":"1d725a0797bae6df","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Oracle Computation","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation — ZFC Recursion2 Oracle Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation","58-df-zfc-recursion3-oracle-computation"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation — ZFC Recursion2 Oracle Computation","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-oracle-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation — ZFC Recursion2 Oracle Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f0d78eba77f4a30\" href=\"?note=7f0d78eba77f4a30\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\\)</span> 使用内部依赖中的固定有限执行编号，无额外编号参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3OracleComputation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3OracleComputation}_S\\)</span> 为下式定义的四元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land e,x,y\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\Phi_e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\land\\langle\\langle A,x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land e,x,y\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\Phi_e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\land\\langle\\langle A,x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3OracleComputation}_S(A,e,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3OracleComputation}_S(A,e,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>两个原有名称及其不同参数顺序均予保留；计算语义已由内部依赖补齐。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3OracleComputation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land e,x,y\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\Phi_e\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\land\\langle\\langle A,x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}computation}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3OracleComputation}_S(A,e,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)","display":true}],"bytes":1395,"backlinks":[{"id":"da8df6fd73c2eb5e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)$ (oracle-computation value predicate; see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]])"},{"id":"b05025919ce89136","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n)$ 使用 [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]] 的固定程序编号及有限执行语义。"},{"id":"227c7eaf354f0ec0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]])"},{"id":"08babcd57560d642","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-2"